# Dataset directories.
#   Benchmark-critical "Tier-1" files (config, mask, Pyrologix risk map, scenarii)
#   for 2021-2024 ARE committed below (~47 MB total). The bulk daily/yearly WFPI
#   rasters and other large inputs are hosted separately (see README > Datasets).
California2019Dataset*/
California2020Dataset_Day1*/
California2021Dataset_Day1*/
MiniCalifornia2020Datasets*/

# California2020: keep only the Fig-6 union-of-burnable mask, ignore the rest.
California2020Dataset/*
!California2020Dataset/mask_union_burnable_no_snow_excluded_day1.npy

# California 2021: ignore bulk rasters, keep Tier-1.
California2021Dataset/*
!California2021Dataset/config_california_2021.json
!California2021Dataset/mask.npy
!California2021Dataset/static_risk_pyrologix.npy
!California2021Dataset/scenarii
California2021Dataset/scenarii/*
!California2021Dataset/scenarii/*.npy

# California 2022: ignore bulk rasters, keep Tier-1.
California2022Dataset/*
!California2022Dataset/config_california_2022.json
!California2022Dataset/mask.npy
!California2022Dataset/static_risk_pyrologix.npy
!California2022Dataset/scenarii
California2022Dataset/scenarii/*
!California2022Dataset/scenarii/*.npy

